WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:10.000
In a project, go down to its tasks

2
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.600
Tap Select

3
00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:18.600
Tap each task you want to change

4
00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:20.400
One…

5
00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:22.300
…two…

6
00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:24.100
…three

7
00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:26.600
The bar counts them

8
00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:30.100
Change them all at once

9
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:34.100
In Progress, say

10
00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:44.600
All three are In Progress — and Undo is right there
